Fonts (not vendored here)

The production PDF/A-3b profile embeds Source Sans 3 and Source Code Pro
(Copyright Adobe Systems Incorporated), licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1. These font files are NOT included in this repository. Fetch them from
the Adobe Fonts GitHub organisation (https://github.com/adobe-fonts) or Google
Fonts into a local `fonts/` directory for embedded-font rendering, or use the
Faktorei container, which ships them. The base-14 quickstart render requires no
font fetch and embeds no third-party fonts.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Validation artefacts (not vendored here)

Official validation artefacts are fetched at build time by specwatch/pull.py and
are NOT included in this repository. They remain the property of their respective
publishers — OpenPeppol, CEN (EN 16931), KoSIT (XRechnung), and the ISO Schematron
skeleton — under their own terms. The pinned sources are listed in
specwatch/sources.yaml.
